OL,3,GNEWSAMan held after goalposts stolen
OL,4,Afrom playing fields
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after football
OL,7,Fgoalposts were stolen from playing
OL,8,Ffields.
OL,10,FMerseyside Police said the incident in
OL,11,FArrowe Park, near Birkenhead, had been
OL,12,Freported at about 07:15 BST.
OL,14,FLocal resident Stacey Owen said her
OL,15,Fhusband had noticed the damage while on
OL,16,Fa dog walk, adding that it was
OL,17,F"devastating for the local community"
OL,18,Fbecause the football pitches were used
OL,19,Fby people of all ages from across
OL,20,FWirral.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
