OL,3,GNEWSAMan held after goalposts stolen
OL,4,Afrom playing fields
OL,5,
OL,6,FA force spokesperson said the goalposts
OL,7,Fhad since been retrieved and a
OL,8,F29-year-old man from Woodchurch had
OL,9,Fbeen detained on suspicion of theft and
OL,10,Fremained in custody.
